Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.222.141.21","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"213739228e02c0773a6ea7340d6cd50f","RawContent":"Hi ladies\n\nI&#039;m planning on a Vegas wedding after my fiance and I went from the UK last year. We are looking at the wynn (I think!) So many options! We had narrowed it down to there, mandalay bay, caesers palace or an off strip resort called the Grove.  Any ideas or information would be gratefully received it is so hard to choose!!\n\nMany thanks","Attachments":[],"Id":1903144,"PostDate":1440366422,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies<br>\nI'm planning on a Vegas wedding after my fiance and I went from the UK last year. We are looking at the wynn (I think!) So many options! We had narrowed it down to there, mandalay bay, caesers palace or an off strip resort called the Grove.  Any ideas or information would be gratefully received it is so hard to choose!!<br>\nMany thanks \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"eeclay@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"90.222.141.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439762789,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"newlyengaged12","Id":284445,"Name":"newlyengaged12","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"a02a4a06bd1b360b4e8b6464dd9208c3","RawContent":"Just want to say congrats!!! I just got back today from my honeymoon in Vegas. I LOVE the Wynn. If you can make it affordable in your budget I vote for that. There is a Vegas section but not too many brides recently. Good luck\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1903145,"PostDate":1440366530,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just want to say congrats!!! I just got back today from my honeymoon in Vegas. I LOVE the Wynn. If you can make it affordable in your budget I vote for that. There is a Vegas section but not too many brides recently. Good luck<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399432202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.222.141.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"af991540633ea3ab6100100260759b15","RawContent":"Thank u so much and hope you had a wonderful time!! It is quite expensive but hey I&#039;m only doing it once ha ha! I love the look of their outdoor area!","Attachments":[],"Id":1903151,"PostDate":1440367895,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank u so much and hope you had a wonderful time!! It is quite expensive but hey I'm only doing it once ha ha! I love the look of their outdoor area! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"eeclay@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"90.222.141.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439762789,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"newlyengaged12","Id":284445,"Name":"newlyengaged12","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ac3dc8c37ead629a39c6b40fb495a07","RawContent":"Yes it is pricey but if you&#039;ve ever been in the Wynn it certainly will wow you. Gorgeous location. \n\n\nI really wanted to marry in Vegas but Mexico won. So many places!! Paris was high on my list as well. I have a friend from high school who married at Mandalay Bay and another at Flamingo. All gorgeous.  \n\n\nI saw your other post. When do you plan to marry? Depending how far you want to drive you could do the Oregon coast or Seattle.   I&#039;ve heard it&#039;s gorgeous. Seattle def is :). LA and San Fran are also good choices. I&#039;ve never been but have friends who go a lot. Lots to see and do there. And it&#039;s not too too far a drive.  \n\n\nIf you drove you may be able to see the Hoover Dam and Grand Canyon too - they are Arizona though. Absolutely breathtaking. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1903153,"PostDate":1440369097,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yes it is pricey but if you've ever been in the Wynn it certainly will wow you. Gorgeous location. <br><br>\nI really wanted to marry in Vegas but Mexico won. So many places!! Paris was high on my list as well. I have a friend from high school who married at Mandalay Bay and another at Flamingo. All gorgeous.  <br><br>\nI saw your other post. When do you plan to marry? Depending how far you want to drive you could do the Oregon coast or Seattle.   I've heard it's gorgeous. Seattle def is <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. LA and San Fran are also good choices. I've never been but have friends who go a lot. Lots to see and do there. And it's not too too far a drive.  <br><br>\nIf you drove you may be able to see the Hoover Dam and Grand Canyon too - they are Arizona though. Absolutely breathtaking. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399432202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.106","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5cb7e23419c506f033fa764fc052cb8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and welcome! Vegas is on my wish list so I&#039;m afraid I won&#039;t be any help. But I wondered if you have guests going with you? Have you talked to a travel agent? Does the hotel have wedding packages that give you what you want? I remember looking at Mandalay Bay and I seem to remember they had a rooftop pool area that looked like a beach, so it looked like you were actually getting married on a beach!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Definitely take a look through the site. There might be reviews that will be a little bit helpful. Otherwise I would definitely consider talking to a travel agent and see if they can shed some light on your wants and must haves, as well as the don&#039;t wants!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and keep us posted!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903166,"PostDate":1440383387,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats and welcome! Vegas is on my wish list so I'm afraid I won't be any help. But I wondered if you have guests going with you? Have you talked to a travel agent? Does the hotel have wedding packages that give you what you want? I remember looking at Mandalay Bay and I seem to remember they had a rooftop pool area that looked like a beach, so it looked like you were actually getting married on a beach!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Definitely take a look through the site. There might be reviews that will be a little bit helpful. Otherwise I would definitely consider talking to a travel agent and see if they can shed some light on your wants and must haves, as well as the don't wants!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and keep us posted!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
