Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.222.141.21","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79524,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c2c12d9f746a73c34539463d9d147a0","RawContent":"We are thinking of hiring a car and driving to LA \/ San Francisco?  We love a road trip! As I&#039;m from UK does anyone have any ideas or suggestions please? Tia x","Attachments":[],"Id":1903152,"PostDate":1440368396,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are thinking of hiring a car and driving to LA \/ San Francisco?  We love a road trip! As I'm from UK does anyone have any ideas or suggestions please? Tia x\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"eeclay@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"90.222.141.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439762789,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"newlyengaged12","Id":284445,"Name":"newlyengaged12","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.106","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79524,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"63df4c8d31948734a771b1ad8cbfc179","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We did a drive of LA and up the coast a bit and really enjoyed it. We did the fancy stores on Rodeo Drive (from a distance course! lol) and also did up where the Hollywood sign is by the observatory, Mulholland Drive where some of the stars live, Malibu, couple of the beach areas along there (Redondo was one of them). I loved LA and we&#039;ve always said we would go back. San Francisco is supposed to be gorgeous too. Depending on how far you want to go and how much time you have, you could go right up the coast or as @[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] suggested into Arizona to Lake Meade and the Hoover Dam area.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903171,"PostDate":1440383967,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We did a drive of LA and up the coast a bit and really enjoyed it. We did the fancy stores on Rodeo Drive (from a distance course! lol) and also did up where the Hollywood sign is by the observatory, Mulholland Drive where some of the stars live, Malibu, couple of the beach areas along there (Redondo was one of them). I loved LA and we've always said we would go back. San Francisco is supposed to be gorgeous too. Depending on how far you want to go and how much time you have, you could go right up the coast or as @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> suggested into Arizona to Lake Meade and the Hoover Dam area.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
